CONTRACT MODIFICATION
LJd.
Contract Modification:
#3
Project:
Cable Television Franchise Negotiations;
Wireless Communication Facilities Regulations for Small Cells
Project Number:
Contract # 6743
Contractor:
River Oaks Communications Corporation
Effective Date:
March 1,2019
The above-referenced is modified as set forth in the following, and these amendments and
modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. Ml other aspects of the
original agreement remain unchanged and in 11111 force and effect.
I.
Description of Chanues.
The City ofCheyenne (“City”) and River Oaks Communications Corporation (“River Oaks”)
entered into a professional services agreement dated October 24, 2017. That contract bears city
contract number 6743 (“Agreement”). The Agreement, as amended effective April 23,2018 and as
amended effective July 30, 2018, contemplates completion of the scope of work identified therein
by February 28, 2019. The parties agree additional time is needed for the drafting and negotiation
of the Charter Communications Cable Television Franchise Agreement, and the drafting.
development and finalization of the new Wireless Communication Facilities Regulations for Small
Cells.
II.
New Contract Items.
The new contract items identified here are additional time to complete the scope of work
identified in the Agreement, and the drafting, development and finalization of the new Wireless
Communication Facilities Regulations for Small Cells for the City.
III.
Schedule.
This contract modification extends the completion of service date from February 28, 2019
to May 31, 2019.
N.
Summary.
Original Contract Amount
$51,635.00
Previous Modifications
$15,000.00
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification
$66,635.00
This Modification
$15,000.00
New Contract Amount
$81,635.00
